id: DRAFT-liborcus-0.21.0-automake-summary-spacing-xfail-pass
trigger_tool: make|conan
phase: testing
error_signature: \[upstream\] # FAIL:  \d+|HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"status":\s*"failed"[^}]*"passed":\s*0
severity: 3
category: autotools, testing, build-system, ohos
match_keywords: automake-check, hmbs_upstream_test_result, test-suite-summary, xfail
title: automake test-suite汇总双空格对齐解析修复与XFAIL计入通过，真机rc=0时避免零计数误判failed
root_cause: conanfile.py _run_upstream_tests用单空格正则解析automake test-suite汇总，automake对个位数用双空格对齐导致PASS/FAIL等行漏匹配，total累加但passed/failed为0而误判failed，且XFAIL未计入通过
affected_scope: 使用automake test-suite汇总(# TOTAL/# PASS/# FAIL/# SKIP/# ERROR/# XFAIL/# XPASS)并经HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT证据门禁的autotools类库
verification_cmd: 真机preflight日志应显示HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT status passed discovered 39 executed 39 passed 39 failed 0，且[upstream]汇总行无漏计
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: fix-automake-summary-spacing-and-count-xfail
rec_description: 将汇总解析两处正则分隔符由单空格改为\s+兼容单双空格，并将XFAIL计入passed以反映预期失败非失败语义
rec_command: archives/l/liborcus/0.21.0/conanfile.py _run_upstream_tests内summaries与finditer两处正则改为# (TOTAL|PASS|FAIL|SKIP|ERROR|XFAIL|XPASS):\s+(\d+)并将XFAIL累加到passed
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: manual-summary-audit
fallback_description: 若汇总行仍缺失则保留原始make check日志做人工审计计数，不放宽门禁直接标记通过
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"status":\s*"failed"[^}]*"passed":\s*0[^}]*"failed":\s*0
forbid_1_reason: 禁止在rc=0且汇总含双空格PASS行时输出passed 0 failed 0的零计数failed误判，必须先修复\s+解析再判定
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检evidence incomplete或误判失败，任务退回修复循环并掩盖39个TESTS真实通过
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-liborcus-0.21.0-automake-summary-spacing-xfail-pass.md
last_updated: 2026-09-18
source_event: liborcus/0.21.0真机预检make check rc=0但汇总解析为failed，修复为\s+兼容与XFAIL计入通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 10893
